  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the well being and autonomy of returnees and host communities in 23 targeted villages in the Casamance through access to secure shelters, WASH facilities and safe drinking water, and strengthened social cohesion</narrative>
